#!/bin/bash
set -euo pipefail
# /usr/local/bin/captive-portal
# Create rogue AP with captive portal for credential harvesting
# Uses 84 portal templates adapted from Raspyjack
# Supports: wifi, corporate, social, custom portal types

PORTAL_DIR="/opt/cardputer/config/captive"
LOOT_DIR="/opt/cardputer/loot/recon"
HOSTAPD_CONF="/tmp/captive_hostapd.conf"
DNSMASQ_CONF="/tmp/captive_dnsmasq.conf"

RED='\033[0;31m'
CYAN='\033[0;36m'
GREEN='\033[0;32m'
YELLOW='\033[1;33m'
NC='\033[0m'

PORTAL_TYPES=(
    "wifi:Wi-Fi Login Portal"
    "corporate:Corporate VPN Login"
    "social:Social Media Login"
    "email:Email Provider Login"
    "bank:Online Banking Login"
    "cloud:Cloud Storage Login"
    "hotel:Hotel Guest Wi-Fi"
    "airport:Airport Wi-Fi"
    "coffee:Coffee Shop Wi-Fi"
    "library:Library Network Login"
    "gym:Gym Member Wi-Fi"
)

usage() {
    echo -e "${CYAN}captive-portal${NC} — Rogue AP + Captive Portal for ZERO-DAY OS"
    echo ""
    echo "Usage: captive-portal <command> [args]"
    echo ""
    echo "Commands:"
    echo "  start <ap_iface> <inet_iface> <essid> [type]  Start captive portal"
    echo "  stop                                           Stop captive portal"
    echo "  status                                         Show portal status"
    echo "  list                                           List portal templates"
    echo "  logs                                           Show captured credentials"
    echo "  create <type>                                  Create custom portal from template"
    echo ""
    echo "Portal types:"
    for pt in "${PORTAL_TYPES[@]}"; do
        IFS=':' read -r type desc <<< "$pt"
        echo "  $type        $desc"
    done
    echo ""
    echo "Examples:"
    echo "  sudo captive-portal start wlan0 eth0 'Free_WiFi' wifi"
    echo "  sudo captive-portal start wlan0 eth0 'Corporate VPN' corporate"
    echo "  sudo captive-portal stop"
    echo "  sudo captive-portal logs"
}

check_deps() {
    for cmd in hostapd dnsmasq python3 iptables; do
        if ! command -v "$cmd" &>/dev/null; then
            echo -e "${RED}[!] $cmd not found. Install: apt install hostapd dnsmasq python3 iptables${NC}"
            exit 1
        fi
    done
}

